WEBVTT

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:11.144
Ai, Just on my love

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:17.484
<i>Kono te de omae 0 mamoritai</i>

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:31.765
Honto no otoko o shitteiru kai?

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.903
Horeteru onna ni yowai sa

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:40.107
Aitsu wa ore yori yasashikute

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.211
Aitsu wa ore yori tsuyoino kai

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.984
Tsuki yo ga tsumetaku

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.887
Kokoro terasu

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:03.263
Omoi ga kage e to utsusarete

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.334
Ai, Just on my love

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:13.373
<i>Kono te de omae 0 mamoritai</i>

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:21.949
<i>Al onna jounetsu omae ga kureta mono</i>

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:30.591
It's coming.

00:01:44.805 --> 00:01:45.973
Deep Dragon...

00:01:51.612 --> 00:01:53.747
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:59.152
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:02:11.765 --> 00:02:13.266
Master!

00:02:22.509 --> 00:02:23.577
Master...

00:02:23.877 --> 00:02:24.778
Fiena!

00:02:38.492 --> 00:02:39.860
| beg of you!

00:02:40.627 --> 00:02:43.430
Please forgive these humans.

00:02:52.072 --> 00:02:53.206
| beg you!

00:02:59.246 --> 00:03:00.514
Master!

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:11.625
Master? Master!

00:03:12.025 --> 00:03:13.694
Master!

00:03:16.229 --> 00:03:22.235
The wolf that
CRIES IN OUR FOREST

00:03:24.638 --> 00:03:26.840
Master? Master!

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:29.443
Run, Majic, they will soon come.

00:03:29.443 --> 00:03:32.913
Fiena, what did that dragon do?

00:03:33.847 --> 00:03:35.415
To my master?

00:03:35.415 --> 00:03:37.818
There isn't any time. Please!

00:03:37.818 --> 00:03:39.586
You must escape.

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:42.122
| can't go and leave my master!

00:03:42.122 --> 00:03:44.458
| shall take responsibility for him.

00:03:44.458 --> 00:03:45.325
Fiena...

00:03:45.325 --> 00:03:48.128
Now you shall listen to me, and save yourself.

00:03:48.128 --> 00:03:51.364
Wait for the chance to save him.

00:03:52.933 --> 00:03:55.135
Tomorrow morn, wait in the forest
where first we met.

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:57.904
Quickly!

00:03:58.305 --> 00:03:59.806
I leave him in your care!

00:04:41.548 --> 00:04:43.316
Just ten more minutes.

00:04:43.316 --> 00:04:44.985
Even five minutes is okay.

00:04:44.985 --> 00:04:46.620
Okay? Let me sleep?

00:04:51.324 --> 00:04:53.160
It's the wrath of the Deep Dragon.

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:55.529
Something awful is about to
happen to the village!

00:04:55.529 --> 00:04:59.332
We should have killed the sorcerer,
just as the law states!

00:04:59.332 --> 00:05:01.902
| shall return that man to the outside world.

00:05:02.469 --> 00:05:04.171
But that's stupid!

00:05:05.205 --> 00:05:06.773
Listen to me!

00:05:06.773 --> 00:05:11.611
He is not an evil sorcerer
trying to bring strife to this village.

00:05:11.611 --> 00:05:15.115
Then why did the Deep Dragon appear?

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.820
It's not a matter of good or bad with a sorcerer.

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:21.888
His mere existence is the problem!

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:34.267
Fiena!

00:05:34.267 --> 00:05:35.302
Majic!

00:05:39.472 --> 00:05:40.740
My master?

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.676
He's safe, but...

00:05:44.411 --> 00:05:49.049
The Deep Dragon's psychic attack
destroyed his psyche.

00:05:49.416 --> 00:05:50.817
Psychic attack?

00:05:50.817 --> 00:05:55.555
If he were a normal sorcerer,
his body would have been destroyed too.

00:05:55.555 --> 00:05:56.690
That's...

00:05:57.224 --> 00:06:01.294
And the villagers are shouting
to have the sorcerer killed.

00:06:01.294 --> 00:06:04.464
To kill my master? How awful!

00:06:08.235 --> 00:06:11.438
I can no longer hold them back.

00:06:11.438 --> 00:06:14.608
Batrov is prodding them on.

00:06:14.608 --> 00:06:18.411
That Batrov! He's just a wandering poacher.

00:06:18.845 --> 00:06:19.880
Poacher?!

00:06:20.347 --> 00:06:22.515
Fiena, you are...

00:06:22.515 --> 00:06:26.253
Can't you use your power to heal my master?

00:06:32.025 --> 00:06:34.828
| don't know, because I've never tried.

00:06:35.328 --> 00:06:37.330
No, it's probably too much for me.

00:06:37.931 --> 00:06:41.401
Listen Fiena, Batrov's even made
gunpowder in the village.

00:06:42.068 --> 00:06:45.438
The only one who can defeat him is my master.

00:06:45.438 --> 00:06:46.373
Gunpowder?

00:06:47.674 --> 00:06:48.842
| beg you!

00:06:48.842 --> 00:06:51.811
With your power, please heal my master.

00:06:55.048 --> 00:06:56.216
I'll help you too.

00:07:14.134 --> 00:07:16.403
Lady Fiena, it's time.

00:07:18.705 --> 00:07:20.040
Lady Fiena!

00:07:31.051 --> 00:07:33.219
Look! Most of the gunpowder is gone.

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:35.188
Something's weird here.

00:07:35.188 --> 00:07:38.124
We haven't seen Batrov or
anyone else since morning.

00:07:38.124 --> 00:07:41.828
Now's our chance!
Before they start something!

00:07:42.162 --> 00:07:43.129
Escape?

00:07:43.129 --> 00:07:45.432
We're going to reclaim the Sword of Baltanders!

00:07:45.432 --> 00:07:46.466
Big Brother...

00:07:48.501 --> 00:07:49.502
Yeah, yeah!

00:07:49.502 --> 00:07:52.472
We'll also claim our share of goods
for all the work we've done.

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:03.383
We've dumped the sorcerer in, Lady Fiena.

00:08:16.663 --> 00:08:18.865
I shall enter your soul.

00:08:28.475 --> 00:08:33.546
Hurry! We'll carry out our plan while they're
excited over the execution of the sorcerer.

00:08:34.214 --> 00:08:35.348
Hurry up!

00:08:35.348 --> 00:08:36.616
Don't be so slow!

00:08:36.616 --> 00:08:37.684
Kill him!

00:08:37.984 --> 00:08:39.819
Hurry up, and just do it!

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:44.791
Master!

00:08:44.791 --> 00:08:46.092
That's not Lady Fiena!

00:08:46.092 --> 00:08:46.993
He's a fake!

00:08:47.527 --> 00:08:48.628
Fiena!

00:09:16.389 --> 00:09:19.059
| beg of you, please tell me.

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.262
Where is this?

00:09:22.262 --> 00:09:24.264
Who am I?

00:09:25.131 --> 00:09:26.733
Wait!

00:09:29.235 --> 00:09:30.336
Orphen...

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.875
Who are you?

00:09:35.875 --> 00:09:37.610
| am Fiena.

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:38.745
Fiena?

00:09:39.212 --> 00:09:42.348
Your psyche has been destroyed,

00:09:42.348 --> 00:09:44.918
and you are now wandering
the maze of your memories.

00:09:50.924 --> 00:09:53.726
No way! No way! No way!

00:09:53.726 --> 00:09:54.928
Water!

00:09:55.662 --> 00:09:56.563
Orphen!

00:10:10.243 --> 00:10:12.445
No, calm your soul.

00:10:13.046 --> 00:10:14.380
Let me in.

00:10:46.212 --> 00:10:47.280
She's dead.

00:11:05.465 --> 00:11:07.000
Where is this?

00:11:07.467 --> 00:11:09.602
These are my memories.

00:11:09.602 --> 00:11:10.837
Yours?

00:11:11.371 --> 00:11:14.674
Now, I shall lead you to the exit.

00:11:22.115 --> 00:11:23.783
Please, open...

00:11:25.151 --> 00:11:26.653
Open your eyes.

00:11:31.724 --> 00:11:34.360
Fiena! Master!

00:12:09.495 --> 00:12:11.364
The sorcerer's back from the dead!

00:12:11.364 --> 00:12:12.632
Master!

00:12:14.467 --> 00:12:16.469
Fiena, thank you!

00:12:16.469 --> 00:12:17.670
Majic!

00:12:19.405 --> 00:12:20.907
Listen to what I have to say!

00:12:21.641 --> 00:12:25.578
The one you trust, Batrov, is a poacher!

00:12:25.578 --> 00:12:27.780
He'll probably burn down the forest.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:30.283
He plans to capture the offspring
of the Deep Dragon!

00:12:30.283 --> 00:12:32.085
Herr Batrov is?

00:12:32.085 --> 00:12:35.255
You lie! It's just lies! As if Herr Batrov-

00:12:35.255 --> 00:12:36.222
It's true.

00:12:36.689 --> 00:12:39.859
I've looked into this man's soul.

00:12:39.859 --> 00:12:41.494
It is not a lie.

00:12:41.494 --> 00:12:44.597
The one who brings strife
to the village is Batrov!

00:12:50.603 --> 00:12:51.537
We're too late!

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:26.506
What do you mean by this?
Hurry up and let me down!

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:29.409
You're my sweet moneymaker.

00:13:29.409 --> 00:13:31.311
I'll take good care of you.

00:13:31.611 --> 00:13:33.913
Sister, from now on, you're my woman.

00:13:33.913 --> 00:13:35.348
Woman?!

00:13:45.525 --> 00:13:48.094
Herr Batrov, I think we've been found out!

00:13:48.094 --> 00:13:49.562
Let's stop now.

00:13:49.562 --> 00:13:51.130
What are you saying?

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:53.800
Never mind, hurry up and let the rope down.

00:13:55.535 --> 00:13:57.036
I'm quitting!

00:13:57.036 --> 00:13:58.037
Me too!

00:13:59.172 --> 00:14:00.940
Cowards!

00:14:08.781 --> 00:14:09.649
Don't move!

00:14:33.473 --> 00:14:35.475
The Dragon is angry.

00:14:42.782 --> 00:14:44.917
The dragon's child will sell for a high price!

00:14:44.917 --> 00:14:47.220
There are a lot of rich people who want him!

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:49.122
Quit thinking stupid thoughts!

00:14:49.122 --> 00:14:52.024
The Dragon's rage will decimate the village.

00:14:52.024 --> 00:14:53.359
So what?

00:14:53.359 --> 00:14:57.864
What do I care about this village
bound by stupid laws?

00:14:58.097 --> 00:14:59.332
You!

00:15:00.299 --> 00:15:02.068
Ow! You!

00:15:02.068 --> 00:15:04.003
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:15:09.175 --> 00:15:12.245
I'm so sorry, but this one's mine.

00:15:27.493 --> 00:15:28.494
Fiena?

00:15:29.529 --> 00:15:32.198
The Dragon didn't forgive me.

00:15:32.198 --> 00:15:34.967
| am a failure as a priestess.

00:15:34.967 --> 00:15:37.804
We did as much as we could.

00:15:39.338 --> 00:15:42.875
You risked your life to save my master.

00:15:43.643 --> 00:15:44.944
I'm grateful.

00:15:46.279 --> 00:15:48.247
This is the end of this village.

00:15:48.815 --> 00:15:50.049
Hurry and escape.

00:15:52.919 --> 00:15:54.654
I'll stay here too.

00:15:56.422 --> 00:15:58.991
I've decided that I'll stay with you.

00:16:00.126 --> 00:16:01.427
Majic!

00:16:19.879 --> 00:16:20.980
Hurry up!

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:22.114
I'm C o] m in g !

00:16:24.484 --> 00:16:25.818
Wait a minute, you two!

00:16:25.818 --> 00:16:27.353
Lend me a hand.

00:16:27.353 --> 00:16:28.354
What?

00:16:29.589 --> 00:16:33.659
So, you've finally realized my greatness
you hellion sorcerer!

00:16:33.659 --> 00:16:35.261
But don't be so spoiled.

00:16:35.261 --> 00:16:36.896
Like I'd lend you a ha-

00:16:36.896 --> 00:16:37.730
Ow, ow, ow!

00:16:40.099 --> 00:16:43.503
Wait! Didn't you already beat him up? Hey!

00:16:43.836 --> 00:16:45.705
The dragon's child is mine!

00:16:45.705 --> 00:16:47.473
| won't let anyone else have it!

00:16:54.046 --> 00:16:55.748
D-Deep Dragon!

00:16:55.748 --> 00:16:56.983
That's enough, you guys.

00:16:56.983 --> 00:16:57.917
Yes!

00:16:58.317 --> 00:17:00.152
Hey, remember this well!

00:17:00.152 --> 00:17:04.056
I'll have you repay this debt double,
you malicious sorcerer!

00:17:04.056 --> 00:17:05.124
We're going, Dortin!

00:17:05.124 --> 00:17:07.860
Wait, Big Brother!

00:17:18.471 --> 00:17:20.473
Tower of Heaven, dance around me!

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:26.212
Spire of the Sun, that I build!

00:17:35.955 --> 00:17:38.391
You, give my dragon back!

00:17:46.032 --> 00:17:47.033
Orphen!

00:17:53.573 --> 00:17:55.074
What's wrong, Leki?

00:17:55.074 --> 00:17:56.075
It can't be!

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:23.803
The village disappeared.

00:18:25.037 --> 00:18:26.105
The village!

00:18:26.105 --> 00:18:27.106
What's happening?!

00:18:27.106 --> 00:18:28.007
We'll all be killed!

00:18:28.007 --> 00:18:30.409
It's no good. The scale is too large.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:34.347
Please, if you're a dragon too,
then do something.

00:18:35.247 --> 00:18:36.949
Save us.

00:18:40.086 --> 00:18:41.087
What?

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:51.864
Leki!

00:18:59.171 --> 00:19:01.474
What's with that? Are they talking?

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:16.489
Fiena! Fiena!

00:19:26.298 --> 00:19:27.400
Fiena...

00:19:32.304 --> 00:19:35.474
Did this baby convince the dragons?

00:19:35.474 --> 00:19:36.942
Probably.

00:19:39.545 --> 00:19:40.613
Majic!

00:19:43.916 --> 00:19:46.619
Master, Fiena died.

00:19:47.887 --> 00:19:51.457
She died once before,

00:19:54.627 --> 00:19:58.197
but she was brought to life again
by the power of the Dragon,

00:19:58.197 --> 00:20:00.032
to serve as a priestess.

00:20:02.234 --> 00:20:07.573
That's why for her to leave
this village meant death.

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:09.408
Fiena!

00:20:18.084 --> 00:20:18.884
Fiena?

00:20:24.256 --> 00:20:25.191
Fiena!

00:20:25.691 --> 00:20:26.659
Majic!

00:20:36.235 --> 00:20:39.472
The Dragon left me with these words,

00:20:39.472 --> 00:20:42.608
"Should we be overtaken,
then we must capitulate.

00:20:42.842 --> 00:20:45.878
Even if the master is human."

00:20:46.245 --> 00:20:47.379
Human?

00:20:47.379 --> 00:20:50.483
Just like that dragon's child, who chose her.

00:20:50.483 --> 00:20:51.851
Is that so?

00:20:52.485 --> 00:20:58.257
It may be because of that dragon's child
that the villagers and I were forgiven.

00:20:58.257 --> 00:20:59.925
Leki, wait!

00:20:59.925 --> 00:21:01.160
Leki?

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:03.329
My baby's name. It's Leki!

00:21:03.329 --> 00:21:04.730
Now, be nice to him!

00:21:05.131 --> 00:21:08.367
That thing we were talking about?
Keep it a secret from her.

00:21:12.738 --> 00:21:16.876
Sorry, Majic, I can't go with you.

00:21:17.777 --> 00:21:21.347
I think the Dragon gave me
another chance at life

00:21:23.215 --> 00:21:28.053
so that I may lead the villagers
in building a new village.

00:21:29.889 --> 00:21:31.791
You seem pretty determined.

00:21:32.691 --> 00:21:33.692
Yes...

00:21:34.260 --> 00:21:37.029
| understand. I'll cheer for you from afar.

00:21:38.164 --> 00:21:41.467
Thank you. I shall not forget you.

00:21:42.568 --> 00:21:43.669
Fiena...

00:21:44.637 --> 00:21:45.771
Majic...

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:52.411
Let's go, Majic!

00:21:52.878 --> 00:21:54.980
Yes, I'm coming right now!

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:18.871
Say, Orphen, why are we crossing
the sea to a no-man's island?

00:22:19.471 --> 00:22:23.609
The Sword of Baltanders was
an artifact found on that island?

00:22:23.609 --> 00:22:26.412
Then a clue to saving
that person named Azalie...

00:22:27.046 --> 00:22:28.881
What is that beast?!

00:22:28.881 --> 00:22:31.851
What's going on with this island anyway?

00:22:32.117 --> 00:22:34.119
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:34.119 --> 00:22:36.388
the ruins of saltandenrs
"The Ruins of Baltanders."

00:22:36.388 --> 00:22:38.858
The ruins of saltandenrs
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:49.134 --> 00:22:53.205
Honto ni sukidatta anata ga inai

00:22:53.205 --> 00:22:57.276
Hajimete no koi todomatta

00:22:57.743 --> 00:23:05.985
Konya wa yume ni egao no mama de detekonaide yo ne

00:23:06.619 --> 00:23:10.656
Saigo no serif u kuchi ni dasumade

00:23:10.656 --> 00:23:14.260
Komatteta anata

00:23:15.194 --> 00:23:19.131
Saigo no serif u kuchi ni shitasugu

00:23:19.131 --> 00:23:22.868
Ato nanoni kuchizuke

00:23:23.936 --> 00:23:28.340
Kuchibiru ni dake

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:32.544
Yamete yo anata no nukumori ga

00:23:32.544 --> 00:23:36.916
Kuchibiru ni dake

00:23:36.916 --> 00:23:40.786
Zutto nokotteiru

00:23:41.053 --> 00:23:43.522
Yasashii anata

00:23:43.522 --> 00:23:47.693
Kuchibiru ni dake

00:23:47.693 --> 00:23:51.997
Donani wasureyou to shitemo

00:23:51.997 --> 00:23:56.268
Kuchibiru ni dake

00:23:56.268 --> 00:24:02.474
Zutto nokotteiru

00:24:02.808 --> 00:24:07.413
Saigo no anata
